---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Piotr Łepkowski - Software Engineer - CV">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
    <section class="pt-16 pb-7">
      <a href="/" class="link-accent font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline mb-7.5 inline-flex gap-2">← back to home</a>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(30px,5vw,52px)] font-black tracking-[-1.5px] mt-0 mx-0 mb-1.5 leading-[1]">Selected work</h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-muted m-0">the latest and most interesting projects — details on request</p>
    </section>

    <!-- accordion -->
    <section class="pb-2.5">
      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="acc-item open border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">01</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">EV Charge-Point Management Platform</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Backend engineer and architect of a multi-tenant B2B SaaS for EV charging operators — charge-point management, roaming and billing.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Architected database-per-tenant isolation on NestJS, Drizzle and PostgreSQL serving 50+ operator tenants and 5,000+ charge points, with tooling applying schema migrations across every tenant.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Built a decimal-precise financial engine settling 100k+ charging transactions monthly across 33 modules, eliminating floating-point drift in tariffs, fees and earnings reconciliation.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Delivered REST endpoints across 145 controllers on serverless AWS Lambda with Cognito auth, RBAC guards and Jest suites.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Integrated open charge-point telemetry and roaming protocols (OCPP, OCPI) plus automated regulatory reporting and payment-gateway billing across 5,000+ connectors.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">02</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">Legacy-to-Cloud Data Migration Service</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Sole architect of a standalone service moving 20 B2B tenants off a legacy MySQL system onto per-tenant PostgreSQL in the cloud — ~3M transaction rows and up to 200k accounts per tenant.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Cut per-tenant migration runtime from ~12 hours to ~1 hour through chunked streaming reads, batched inserts and targeted indexing on both engines.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Engineered schema-drift guards that introspect INFORMATION_SCHEMA before each run, absorbing per-tenant differences across 20 legacy databases.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Shipped resumable, idempotent jobs across 20 ordered domain modules with S3 audit trails — ~150 production migrations with zero rollbacks.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 03 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">03</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">Parametric CAD Product Configurator</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>B2B configurator for an industrial manufacturer, embedded in a global e-commerce system across 17 locales; owned the CAD and 3D pipeline end to end in a 6-engineer team.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Automated CAD model delivery with JSCAD and Next.js server actions, cutting turnaround from 1–4 days of manual drafting to 5–10 seconds.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Engineered a deterministic parameter-keyed STL cache serving ~70% of requests straight from disk.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Built save-and-share configurations on Prisma and PostgreSQL plus a three-stage checkout, replacing emailed CAD attachments with a single retrievable URL.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 04 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">04</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">Consumer Travel-Tracking Mobile App</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Tech lead on a ground-up React Native rewrite of a legacy Cordova app tracking travel milestones across 1,500+ regions worldwide.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Scaled the rewrite to 90,000+ downloads and 40,000+ registered users, lifting crash-free sessions from 98.7% to 99.6%.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Cut cold start from 4s to 1.25s on iOS and 9s to 4s on Android and shrank bundle size 22% via app bootstrap, Hermes and MMKV rework.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Engineered a real-time Mapbox GL layer with Turf.js point-in-polygon rendering 2,500+ locations at 60fps, plus offline-first sync supporting 7 days without a connection.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Led architecture and code review across 1,900+ commits, defining the Redux Toolkit, redux-saga and React Query conventions the team built every screen on.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 05 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">05</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">Real-Estate Investment Analytics Platform</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Sole engineer on a B2B SaaS for institutional investors — market scoring, portfolio underwriting and deal simulation — used by 10+ investment firms.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Owned a 58,000-line Next.js and React frontend alongside a serverless Koa API of 62 REST endpoints orchestrating 3 upstream data services.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Reduced production API latency from 1,000 ms to 35–50 ms (96% faster) through hot-path profiling, request batching and response caching on AWS Lambda.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Built a geospatial market-analysis interface with Mapbox GL and Turf.js clustering 1,500 ZIP-code areas per metro, letting analysts draw polygons and score markets in real time.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Virtualized 5,000-row portfolio tables into sub-second sorting, filtering and XLSX/CSV export, and productized a public data API with 25 endpoints and self-serve docs.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 06 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">06</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">B2B Trend &amp; Signal Intelligence Platform</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Enterprise trend and signal intelligence platform for healthcare, FMCG and cosmetics brands.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Architected the migration from a single-tenant MVP to a multi-tenant Next.js and Node/Express platform with organization-scoped isolation on MongoDB, onboarding 5+ enterprise clients.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Engineered a Redis caching layer over MongoDB delivering 10x faster responses on endpoints querying a 2+ petabyte trend dataset.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Rebuilt the analytics dashboards in React with D3 and react-virtualized, cutting load from ~5s to under 1s and eliminating freezes on charts rendering thousands of data objects.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Integrated OpenAI GPT to auto-summarize signals and automated ingestion of news, clinical-trial, social and market data feeding 90 million microtrends into the projection pipeline.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 07 -->
      <div class="acc-item border-t border-b border-line14">
        <div class="acc-head flex items-start gap-5 px-1 py-6 cursor-pointer">
          <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold pt-1.5">07</span>
          <h2 class="flex-1 m-0 text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)] font-bold tracking-[-.5px]">Cross-Platform Productivity SaaS</h2>
          <span class="acc-sign font-mono text-[22px] text-accent w-6 text-center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <ul class="mt-0 mx-0 mb-6 pt-0 pr-1 pb-0 pl-12 list-none flex flex-col gap-3">
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Encrypted, offline-first task-management SaaS across desktop, iOS and Android — built solo end to end, reaching 1,000 users with ~100 paying subscribers.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Designed the offline-first sync architecture behind all 3 clients: per-user CouchDB replicated to local PouchDB with AES-encrypted storage, fully functional with zero connectivity.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Engineered a bidirectional integration engine syncing third-party task services via webhooks, change feeds and Bull queues, with Redis revision locking that eliminated replication loops.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Built the Koa backend from scratch with 44 REST endpoints, JWT auth and end-to-end Stripe billing — checkout, webhooks, trials, coupons, referrals.</li>
            <li class="relative text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-text2 pl-5"><span class="absolute left-0 text-accent font-mono">—</span>Shipped a 53-component Electron and Vue.js app with code-signed, notarized macOS and Windows auto-updates, plus a React Native client with SQLite-backed offline sync.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STACK -->
    <section class="pt-13.5 pb-4.5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8.5">
        <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent font-bold">//</span>
        <span data-text="tech_stack" class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.5px] text-ink font-medium">tech_stack</span>
        <span class="flex-1 h-px bg-line14"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-muted">shipped with</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-sm">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Node.js</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">SQL</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">iOS / Android</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">NestJS</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Next.js</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">React</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">React Native</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Express</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Koa</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Electron</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Astro</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">MongoDB</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">MySQL</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Redis</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">CouchDB</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Drizzle</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Prisma</span>


        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">AWS</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Cognito</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Serverless Framework</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Docker</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">TanStack Query</span>


        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Mapbox GL</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">D3.js</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Three.js</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">JSCAD</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Hermes</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">OpenAI</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Stripe</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Okta</span>

        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Socket.IO</span>
        <span class="tag font-mono text-[12.5px] px-2.75 py-1.5 border border-line18 rounded-[3px]">Bull</span>

      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="h-16"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- projects behaviour: accordion (one open at a time) -->
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var items = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.acc-item'));
      items.forEach(function (item) {
        var head = item.querySelector('.acc-head');
        if (!head) return;
        head.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var wasOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
          items.forEach(function (it) { it.classList.remove('open'); });
          if (!wasOpen) item.classList.add('open');
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</Layout>
